      "message": "How about adding a GPIO device handle to this structure?  This would be redundant with the enable_gpio enum stored in fan_conf. Chromebooks typically only have one fan, so this will consume only 4 bytes of data.",
      "revId": "66ba1033ef6ceb2206593168349e6968132e7281",
